OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FMark Forrest introduces highlights
OL,12,     Ffrom the Proms including music by
OL,13,     FDvorak, chamber performances from
OL,14,     Fthis year's Ryedale Festival and
OL,15,     FBaroque music from Fribourg.
OL,16,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mozart
OL,17,     FKate Molleson explores the
OL,18,     Frelationships that shaped Mozart's
OL,19,     Flife and work, looking today at
OL,20,     Fthe brotherhood of Freemasons.
